| QOQ | cheap | 3m | 66 | +4.8% | +3.8% | +3.5% | +1.0% | 47% | 1.06 |
| QOQ | cheap | 6m | 65 | +8.3% | +7.5% | +7.3% | +0.8% | 55% | 0.65 |
| QOQ | cheap | 12m | 63 | +16.9% | +15.7% | +14.8% | +1.3% | 40% | 0.52 |
